# GitHub remote

This repository publishes to **one** canonical remote:

- **URL:** `https://github.com/Mochimus/DHCP-IPAM.git`
- **Owner:** Mochimus (`Mochimus/DHCP-IPAM`)

Do **not** push, tag, or create pull requests against `mleem97/gregMod.IPAM` or other forks unless the user explicitly asks.

When committing or releasing:

1. Verify `git remote -v` shows `origin` → `https://github.com/Mochimus/DHCP-IPAM.git`
2. Push branches and tags to `origin` on that repository only
3. Use release tags like `0.3.7` or `Version-0.3.x` consistently with prior releases on this repo
